units si
atom_style sphere
boundary m m f
newton off
region domain block -0.15 0.15 -0.15 0.15 -0.005 0.25 units box
create_box 1 domain
comm_modify vel yes
neighbor 0.0005 bin
neigh_modify delay 0 every 1 check yes
pair_style granular
pair_coeff * * hertz/material 50000000.0 0.3 0.25 tangential mindlin NULL 1.0 0.65 rolling sds 1000 0 0.15 damping coeff_restitution
fix floor all wall/gran granular hertz/material 50000000.0 0.3 0.25 tangential mindlin NULL 1.0 0.65 rolling sds 1000 0 0.15 damping coeff_restitution zplane 0 NULL
region funnel cone z 0 0 0.008 0.06 0.1 0.18 open 1 open 2 units box
fix funnel_wall all wall/gran/region granular hertz/material 50000000.0 0.3 0.25 tangential mindlin NULL 1.0 0.65 rolling sds 1000 0 0.15 damping coeff_restitution region funnel
fix gate all wall/gran granular hertz/material 50000000.0 0.3 0.25 tangential mindlin NULL 1.0 0.65 rolling sds 1000 0 0.15 damping coeff_restitution zplane 0.1 NULL
fix integrator all nve/sphere
fix gravity all gravity 9.81 vector 0 0 -1
region feed_zone cylinder z 0 0 0.04 0.185 0.205 units box
fix feed all pour 5766 1 123457 region feed_zone diam one 0.001 dens 2650.0 2650.0 vol 0.25 100
timestep 4e-06
compute kinetic all ke
compute rotation all erotate/sphere
thermo 20000
thermo_style custom step time atoms c_kinetic c_rotation
thermo_modify lost error
dump trajectory all custom 20000 grain8g_d1/particles.dump id type x y z vx vy vz omegax omegay omegaz radius
dump_modify trajectory sort id
run 20000 pre yes post no
run 20000 pre yes post no
run 20000 pre yes post no
run 20000 pre yes post no
run 20000 pre yes post no
run 20000 pre yes post no
run 20000 pre yes post no

# At time 0.56
unfix gate
run 20000 pre yes post no
run 20000 pre yes post no
run 20000 pre yes post no
run 20000 pre yes post no
run 20000 pre yes post no
run 20000 pre yes post no
run 20000 pre yes post no
run 20000 pre yes post no
run 20000 pre yes post no
run 20000 pre yes post no
run 20000 pre yes post no
run 20000 pre yes post no
run 20000 pre yes post no
run 20000 pre yes post no
